        <mxCell id="privacy-layers" value="🔒 PRIVACY BY DESIGN LAYERS&#xa;&#xa;🛡️ Privacy Control Layer&#xa;   • Data Classification Engine&#xa;   • Consent Management System&#xa;   • Privacy Policy Engine&#xa;&#xa;🔐 Data Protection Layer&#xa;   • Encryption Service&#xa;   • Data Anonymization Service&#xa;   • Data Loss Prevention (DLP)&#xa;&#xa;📊 Monitoring &amp; Compliance Layer&#xa;   • Privacy Audit System&#xa;   • Incident Response System&#xa;   • Compliance Reporting System&#xa;&#xa;👤 User Control Layer&#xa;   • Data Subject Rights Management&#xa;   • Privacy Dashboard&#xa;   • Data Portability Service" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
